<title>MALAYSIA: SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD TEAM CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD TEAM CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>PETALING JAYA, Malaysia 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the</p>
<p>final of the women's world team squash championship on Saturday:</p>
<p>Australia beat England 2-1</p>
<p>Michelle Martin lost to Cassie Jackman 3-9 9-4 9-4 7-9 7-9</p>
<p>Sarah FitzGerald beat Linda Charman 9-0 9-1 9-3</p>
<p>Liz Irving beat Fiona Geaves 9-4 9-4 10-8</p>
</text>
